      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef flatten(items):\n    result = []\n    for item in items:\n        if isinstance(item, list):\n            result.extend(flatten(item))\n        else:\n            result.append(item)\n    return result\n\n\nprint(flatten([1, [2, 3], [4, [5, [6]]]]))\nprint(flatten([[], [[]]]))\n```",
